From 3f04b4a9a57af4cab9a6a75198121b6127075ae6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pauleveritt <pauleveritt@me.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:29:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] mellum: mxfp4 moe experts

Resident MXFP4_MOE experts: loading and validation, the expert index and pack
at the quant's own size, the MoE and layer paths for MXFP4 arenas, and
refusal of every mixture by name. Address tables stay with streaming.

Upstream: not offered, fork only
Retire-when: upstream supports JetBrains MXFP4_MOE
Carried-commits: 0adf6bafb1f17e642124b60b183575864f118629 989dc7c8dada668500773328c00d4e851805a842 f6d49a5d57b8566809d53412ac470bd897dd811b 362dca64275b54cd9f6694441618f411fdabd1d5 24175f3845987c0761d4186ec66be7c7735a3f4b 37ccfd165c7d82afd4ef1719c5f0a1acbdac32fd ed405beb79cee502b1c3cf2ce28bd3657118795c 4fa5070983da883b42fc08eb0f0670f4aa4b730a
